      </AsciiMap>
      <p>Each letter (A-N) leads to its corresponding letter on the map. At first, just head straight up to find the Black Chronicle.</p>
      <BossCard name="Shadow (panther), Shadow x2 (cube)" weakness="None">
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> Lead off with <Tag type="skill">Cross Star</Tag> and <Tag type="skill">Will o&#x27; Wisp</Tag> to quickly defeat the cubes. However, the panther will take a few Star Traps and Assaults to defeat.</p>
      </BossCard>
      <p>From the intersection where you start, follow the left path to the end to find a hidden chest which contains the <Tag type="weapon">Freikugel Mercy</Tag> (ATK+25/MAG+90/DEF-15) for <Tag type="char">Eruca</Tag>. Return to the intersection and head up to a chest which contains a <Tag type="item">Panacea Plus</Tag>. Finally, go down the right path and climb down the vine to the next floor.</p>
      <p>Proceed north of the fork to a chest which contains the <Tag type="armor">Nirvana Plate</Tag> (DEF+22/MDF+45/SPD-4). Head right from the fork and climb the vine down to the next floor.</p>
      <p>Walk left to the save point. Climb two vines to an isolated platform. Search above for a hidden chest which contains the <Tag type="weapon">Der Lowe</Tag> (ATK+65/HP+100, equip on <Tag type="char">Rosch</Tag>). Return to the save point and continue left to a fork.</p>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Call for Destruction">
        <p>Head up to a room with a vine to climb down to find a chest which contains <Tag type="item">2 Shield Seed Plus</Tag>. From the fork, head down to a room with a chest which contains a <Tag type="item">Divine Water</Tag> and climb the vine to the next floor.</p>
      </Callout>
      <p>Leave the room to the right, and head up to the end of the path. Search for a hidden chest which contains the <Tag type="acc">Wing Armlet</Tag> (SPD+8). Then, walk to the right.</p>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: The Sacrifice">
        <p>Continue right and climb the vine to a chest which contains a <Tag type="item">Superior Tea</Tag>. Climb back down and head right to a vine to climb down. Go left to a series of vines to climb down to a room with a save point. In the upper right corner is a secret passage you can walk through to a hidden room. Search for a hidden chest in addition to the visible one which contains a <Tag type="item">Tourniquet</Tag> and the <Tag type="key">Icestar Pact</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Aht</Tag>.</p>
      </Callout>
      <p>Return to the save point and bring in <Tag type="char">Gafka</Tag> to replace <Tag type="char">Rosch</Tag>. Then, head up to corner your adversary.</p>
      <BossCard name="Heiss, Shadow x2" weakness="None">
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> Use <Tag type="skill">Push Assault</Tag> on Heiss and a <Tag type="item">Magic Herb</Tag> on <Tag type="char">Aht</Tag>. Then, lay any Star Trap in the lower middle of the grid. Have <Tag type="char">Gafka</Tag> use <Tag type="skill">Wind God Strike</Tag>, followed by a <Tag type="skill">Left Assault</Tag> to take out the two Shadow cubes. Another Star Trap and two Assaults will finish off Heiss. You could steal a <Tag type="acc">King Stud</Tag> (DEF+20/MDF+20) from him and repeat the boss fight over and over again to get an unlimited supply of them, but I don&#x27;t think it&#x27;s worth the time.</p>
      </BossCard>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: The Madness of Heiss">
        <p>Return to the &quot;Aht&#x27;s Prayer&quot; node. Bring in <Tag type="char">Aht</Tag> to replace <Tag type="char">Raynie</Tag> and head southeast to find <Tag type="char">Heiss</Tag> again.</p>
      </Callout>
      <BossCard name="Heiss, Shadow" weakness="None, Lightning">
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> Use the <Tag type="skill">Change</Tag> command to string together three turns, if necessary. <Tag type="skill">Push Assault</Tag> the Shadow, lay a <Tag type="skill">Volt Star Trap</Tag>, and <Tag type="skill">Grapple</Tag> them onto it to kill the Shadow. Then, have <Tag type="char">Marco</Tag> cast <Tag type="skill">Magic Rise</Tag>. Four more of any Star Trap should finish off Heiss.</p>
      </BossCard>
      <p>For defeating <Tag type="boss">Heiss</Tag>, you will unlock [The Sister] node.</p>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 66 -->
  <ChapterCard
