      <p>001 - Daydream ************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>002 - Children of Historia ************************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>003 - Awakening *************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>004 - The Beginning ******************* Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>005 - Specint Assignment ************************ Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>006 - Top Secret Mission ************************ Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>007 - Force Core **************** You must defeat Rosch at Judgment Cliff in Standard Chapter 3 to win his <Tag type="key">Broken Limb</Tag>. Then, return to &quot;The Beginning&quot; node and talk to Sonja to receive the <Tag type="key">Force Core</Tag>.</p>
      <p>008 - Joining Rosch Brigade *************************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>009 - The Closed Mine ********************* Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>010 - The Fallen Capital (ending) ************************ Upon arriving at Alma Mine, choose to &quot;Wait in Ambush&quot; to unlock this ending.</p>
      <p>011 - Breaking Rocks ******************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>012 - Duel in the Dark ********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>013 - Night Watch (sidequest) ***************** During &quot;The Beginning&quot; node, choose to &quot;Join the Rosch Brigade&quot;. Head down to the First Ward and talk to the soldier on the left to receive this sidequest. The earliest opportunities you have to buy the two Anti-Sleeps are at the Sand Fortress in Standard Chapter 1 or in Alistel in Alternate Chapter 1. Repeat the first step and give the two <Tag type="item">Anti-Sleeps</Tag> to the soldier to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="weapon">Alistel Edge</Tag> (ATK+16/MAG+6).</p>
      <p>014 - Soldier Recruit (sidequest) ********************* During &quot;The Beginning&quot; node, choose to &quot;Join the Rosch Brigade&quot;. Talk to the receptionist behind the desk on the left side of the first floor of the castle to receive this sidequest. Head to the inn and talk to the two mercenaries. Return to the receptionist to complete this sidequest and receive <Tag type="gold">1500 G</Tag>.</p>
