      <p>015 - To Granorg **************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>016 - The Bridge at Lazvil ************************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>017 - The Messenger&#x27;s News ************************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>018 - The Queen Ascendant (ending) ************************* During &quot;The Bridge at Lazvil&quot; node, head to Lazvil Hills. Go west to the Highway and down the ramp to revise your destination. Walk south to the Woodland Path East, west around the river, and north to the other side of the river. Choose to &quot;Go to Alma Mine&quot; to unlock this ending.</p>
      <p>019 - No-Show ************* Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>020 - Echoing Hills ******************* Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>021 - Struggle with Bandits *************************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>022 - Breakthrough ****************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>023 - Beastkind *************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>024 - Stocke&#x27;s Display ********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>025 - A Sealed Path (ending) ******************* During the &quot;Beastkind&quot; node, head west to the guard checkpoint at Gran Plain. Choose to &quot;Force your way through&quot; to unlock this ending.</p>
      <p>026 - Sword Dancing ******************* Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>027 - Collecting Wood ********************* Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>028 - Preparing a Meal ********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>029 - Aht&#x27;s Prayer ****************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>030 - The Sister **************** During the &quot;Madness of Heiss&quot; node, return to the &quot;Aht&#x27;s Prayer&quot; node. Defeat Heiss to unlock this node.</p>
      <p>031 - An Ancient City ********************* Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>032 - The King&#x27;s Daughter (sidequest) ************************* During &quot;The Bridge at Lazvil&quot; node at Alistel, head to the tavern at the Second Ward. Climb the stairs to the left and in the upper left corner, talk to the girl, named Anna, to receive this sidequest. During the &quot;An Ancient City&quot; node at Granorg, head to the item shop at the Commercial District, and talk to the merchant there. During &quot;The Resistance&quot; node at Granorg, talk to Eruca. She can be found wearing a cloak, by a tree at the center of the Downtown area. Tell her to &quot;Fulfill your duty&quot;. Return to the &quot;To Granorg&quot; node and talk to Anna to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="acc">Rabbit&#x27;s Foot</Tag> (MP+10/LUC+15). This sidequest is also a prerequisite for unlocking &quot;The Show Goes On&quot; part of the true ending.</p>
      <p>033 - Princess&#x27; Charge (ending) ********************** Follow the above steps up to talking to Eruca. Instead, tell her &quot;Don&#x27;t push yourself&quot; to unlock this ending.</p>
      <p>034 - What Was Inherited (sidequest) ************************ During &quot;The Bridge at Lazvil&quot; node at Alistel, head to the weapon shop at the Second Ward. Talk to the kids nearby to receive this sidequest. Climb the stairs and enter the upper right house. Talk to their father about the sidequest. During the &quot;An Ancient City&quot; node at Granorg, head to the merchant on the left side of the Downtown area. I think you need to talk to the merchant on the right to get some information, though I&#x27;m not sure if this is mandatory. During the &quot;To Cornet Village&quot; node at Cornet, talk to the farmer in the field on the right. Return to the &quot;To Granorg&quot; node and talk to the father. Initially, choose &quot;Don&#x27;t tell him&quot; about the conuts. This will unlock another option. Return to the same node and choose &quot;Tell about reforestation&quot; to complete the sidequest and receive the <Tag type="weapon">Pandur</Tag> (ATK+4/MAG+24/SPD+1). This sidequest is also a prerequisite for unlocking the &quot;Overseers of Time&quot; part of the true ending.</p>
      <p>035 - Distorted Hope (ending) ******************** Follow the above steps up to talking to the father again. Instead, choose to &quot;Tell him&quot; about the conuts to unlock this ending.</p>
      <p>036 - Accident in the Cave (sidequest) ************************** After learning the Bomber skill at Lazvil Hills, return north to where you met the spy and enter the cave. Use the barrel to blow away the rocks. Examine the corpse to receive this sidequest. Return to &quot;The Beginning&quot; node and choose to Join the Rosch Brigade. Continue on with the plot as before and return to the site of the cave-in. Use the barrel to blow away the rocks. Talk to the soldier to complete the sidequest and receive the <Tag type="key">Right-Cut Scroll</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Marco</Tag>, needed for the &quot;Marco the Calm&quot; sidequest.</p>
      <p>037 - The Ultimate Dish (sidequest) *********************** During the &quot;An Ancient City&quot; node at Granorg, head west to the Commercial District. Continue west to the merchants and talk to a man, named Hilster, dressed in green, to receive this sidequest. Return to the &quot;A New Mission&quot; node at Lazvil Hills and head to the Woodland Path. Defeat the Giant Boar to receive the <Tag type="key">Savory Boar Meat</Tag>. Do NOT give this to Hilster yet, or you will lose it and have to do this over again. During the &quot;To Cornet Village&quot; node at Cornet, search the left field for a sparkle that is the <Tag type="key">Savory Veggies</Tag>. Return to the &quot;Castle Sewers&quot; node and talk to Hilster to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="key">Firelight Pact</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Eruca</Tag>, needed for &quot;The Light Trial&quot; sidequest.</p>
      <p>038 - A New Mission ******************* Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>039 - Summoned by Raul ********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>040 - Through Lazvil ******************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
