      <p>043 - The Valkyrie ****************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>044 - Kiel&#x27;s Talent ******************* During &quot;The Valkyrie&quot; node, head up to the second floor of the Sand Fortress. Talk to Kiel on the left end of the floor to learn sword-dancing, upgrade your Strike ability, and unlock this node.</p>
      <p>045 - Conditions Worsen *********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>046 - Front of Despair (ending) ********************** During &quot;The Valkyrie&quot; node, head up to the mess hall at the Sand Fortress in the upper middle room on the first floor, and talk to Rosch to advance the plot. Choose to &quot;Send Reinforcements&quot; to unlock this ending.</p>
      <p>047 - Ambush Tactics ******************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>048 - Sand Fortress Battle ************************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>049 - A Message From Home ************************* Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>050 - Marco the Calm (sidequest) ******************** During the &quot;A New Mission&quot; node at Alistel, on the right side of the first floor are two doors. Enter the left door and talk to the blue soldier to receive this sidequest. You need to find four scrolls for Marco.</p>
      <p>1) <Tag type="key">Right-Cut Scroll</Tag>: Reward from &quot;Accident in the Cave&quot; sidequest. 2) <Tag type="key">Left-Cut Scroll</Tag>: Reward from &quot;Despairing Young Man&quot; sidequest. 3) <Tag type="key">Sleep Gas Scroll</Tag>: During &quot;To Cornet Village&quot; at Cornet, Standard Chapter 3, check out the field to the right. Walk up between the upper row of crops and the fence to find a hidden chest which contains this scroll. 4) <Tag type="key">Roll-Cut Scroll</Tag>: During &quot;To Holff Ruins&quot; at Abyssia Forest, follow the upper path to a large, open area. Search the upper right corner for a hidden chest which contains this scroll.</p>
      <p>After you have obtained any of the scrolls, return to the soldier with them, and he will teach the new abilities to Marco. Learn all four abilities to complete this sidequest.</p>
      <p>051 - Raynie the Active (sidequest) *********************** During the &quot;A New Mission&quot; node at Alistel, on the right side of the first floor are two doors. Enter the left door and talk to the blue soldier to receive this sidequest. You need to find four scrolls for Raynie.</p>
      <p>1) <Tag type="key">Darkshield Scroll</Tag>: During &quot;The Valkyrie&quot; node at the Sand Fortress, head up to the third floor. Walk around the right side, up the stairs, and through the door. Search the right side of the large room for a hidden chest which contains this scroll. 2) <Tag type="key">Slumbering Scroll</Tag>: Reward from &quot;Second Opinion&quot; sidequest. 3) <Tag type="key">Poisoner&#x27;s Scroll</Tag>: This can be found as early as the &quot;Destroy the Ballistas&quot; node in Standard Chapter 5 at the Itolia Wasteland. From the southern entrance, head north one screen, east one, and north two. Search the upper wall for a hidden chest which contains this scroll. 4) <Tag type="key">Piercing Scroll</Tag>: Reward from &quot;The Good Thief&#x27;s Way&quot; sidequest.</p>
      <p>After you have obtained any of the scrolls, return to the soldier with them, and he will teach the new abilities to Raynie. Learn all four abilities to complete this sidequest.</p>
      <p>052 - Red-Letter Day (sidequest) ******************** During the &quot;A New Mission&quot; node at Alistel, head up to the castle and through the right door. Enter the laboratory to the left and talk to the woman, named Meese, to receive this sidequest. If you&#x27;re doing this as early as possible, you will have to talk to Sonja and Raul, then come back down to talk to Sonja again. Return to &quot;The Beginning&quot; node, talk to Rosch on the first floor, and choose to &quot;Send Rosch&quot;. Talk to Meese to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="weapon">P.Thauma Spear</Tag> (ATK+23/DEF+2). This sidequest is also a prerequisite for unlocking the &quot;Iron-Armed General&quot; part of the true ending.</p>
      <p>053 - A Knight&#x27;s End (ending) ******************** Follow the above steps up to talking to Rosch. Instead, choose to &quot;Chase after&quot; Sonja to unlock this ending.</p>
      <p>054 - Flower of Promise (sidequest) *********************** During the &quot;A New Mission&quot; node at Alistel, talk to the woman by the flowers in the lower right corner on the first floor to receive this sidequest. Proceed to &quot;The Beastkind Forest&quot; node at Celestia. Talk to the Satyros above the save point to receive a <Tag type="key">Celestian Flower Bud</Tag>. Return to &quot;The Beginning&quot; node and give it to the questgiver. Continue to the &quot;A New Mission&quot; node and talk to her again to complete this sidequest and receive a <Tag type="acc">Thaumatech Orb</Tag> (MAG+5/MDF+5).</p>
      <p>055 - A Letter to Tomorrow (sidequest) ************************** During the &quot;A New Mission&quot; node at the Second Ward of Alistel, climb the stairs to the left of the tavern, and head all the way down to talk to the man named Cedric to receive this sidequest. Proceed to &quot;The Valkyrie&quot; node at the first floor of the Sand Fortress. Walk around to the right, into the upper middle room, and talk to Viola. Continue to &quot;Alistel&#x27;s Offensive&quot; node and talk to Viola again. Return to Cedric and choose to &quot;Show journal&quot; to complete this sidequest. This sidequest is also a prerequisite for unlocking the &quot;Valkyrie in Repose&quot; part of the true ending.</p>
      <p>056 - A Voice Unheard (ending) ********************* Follow the above steps up to returning to Cedric. Instead, choosing &quot;Don&#x27;t show journal&quot; will unlock this ending.</p>
      <p>057 - Engineer Recruit (sidequest) ********************** During the &quot;A New Mission&quot; node at Alistel, talk to the receptionist behind the desk on the left side of the first floor of the castle to receive this sidequest. Return to &quot;The Closed Mine&quot; node, leave the mine, enter the house by the entrance, and talk to the engineer, Berman. Return to the receptionist to complete this sidequest and receive <Tag type="gold">3000 G</Tag>.</p>
