      <p>067 - Mankind &amp; Beastkind (sidequest) ************************* During the &quot;Duty Revealed&quot; node at Granorg, talk to the guard by the save point at Main Street, to receive this sidequest. Go west to the inn, walk around its left side, and up the stairs to the west to find Liese and talk to her. Return to the soldier and talk to him again. Proceed to the &quot;To Holff Ruins&quot; node at Abyssia Forest. Head south, then east two screens and talk to Liese. Return to the entrance, and follow the northern path to the next screen until you reach an open area. Examine the corpse in the upper right corner. Head back to Liese to talk to her again. Return to the &quot;Castle Sewers&quot; node, talk to Liese, and tell her to &quot;Believe in him&quot;. Talk to the soldier by the save point to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="weapon">Promised Knife</Tag> (ATK+27/MAG+75/HP-30) for <Tag type="char">Aht</Tag>. This sidequest is also a prerequisite for unlocking the &quot;Life of the Beastkind&quot; part of the true ending.</p>
      <p>068 - Chains of Hatred (ending) ********************** Follow the above steps up to talking to Liese at Granorg the second time. Choose to &quot;Leave it to her&quot; to unlock this ending.</p>
