      <p>082 - Swordsman Recruit (sidequest) *********************** During the &quot;Homecoming&quot; node at Alistel, talk to the receptionist on the first floor, behind the left desk to receive this sidequest. Proceed to the &quot;A New Battle&quot; node. You will need to complete &quot;The Next Foe&quot; and &quot;The Road to Victory&quot; sidequests. After doing so, talk to Gadeff to recruit him. Continue to the &quot;In Pursuit&quot; node at Alistel, and talk to the receptionist to complete this sidequest and receive <Tag type="gold">8000 G</Tag>.</p>
      <p>083 - Mercenary Recruit (sidequest) *********************** During the &quot;Homecoming&quot; node at Alistel, talk to the receptionist on the first floor, behind the left desk to receive this sidequest. Proceed to &quot;An Introduction&quot; node at Skalla. After meeting with Tarquin, talk to him a few times to get some information on the mercenary. Return to the &quot;Echoing Hills&quot; node, defeat the bandits again, and talk to Tarquin. Return to Skalla and talk to Tarquin again. Finally, continue to the &quot;In Pursuit&quot; node at Alistel, and talk to the receptionist to complete this sidequest and receive <Tag type="gold">15000 G</Tag>.</p>
