      <p>118 - Wandering Soul (sidequest) ******************** During the &quot;Darkness in Alistel&quot; node, head up and Vanoss will arrive. Talk to him again to receive this sidequest. Proceed to the &quot;Road to Forgia&quot; node and make your way to Skalla. Head to the middle house on the north side of town. Search around the bed for a hidden soul and choose to &quot;Send soul to heavens&quot;. Continue to the &quot;Skalla Liberated&quot; node and head to Skalla. Talk to Vanoss at the northwest side of town to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="armor">Cleansing Cape</Tag> (DEF+30/MDF+36/MAG+5). This sidequest is also a prerequisite for unlocking the &quot;Shaman&quot; part of the true ending.</p>
