      <p>161 - An Unwanted Reunion (sidequest) ************************* During the &quot;Scorched Battlefield&quot; node, head west of the inn to the Plaza. Talk to Ricky along the main road to receive this sidequest. Head to the tavern and talk to the green-haired girl, Mimel, twice. Return to the &quot;Chi-Clad Warrior&quot; node and talk to the bartender. Return to the &quot;Scorched Battlefield&quot; node, talk to Mimel again, and choose to &quot;Let Mimel go.&quot; Talk to Ricky again to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="armor">Sable Larme</Tag> (DEF+33/MDF+25/MAG+5). This sidequest is also a prerequisite for unlocking the &quot;A Little Hero&quot; part of the true ending.</p>
      <p>162 - Simmering Fury (ending) ******************** Follow the above steps until you confront Mimel the second time. Choose to &quot;Capture Mimel&quot; to unlock this ending.</p>
      <p>163 - Battle for Skalla *********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>164 - Rosch&#x27;s Stratagem *********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>165 - Skalla Liberated ********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>166 - Sand Fortress Siege ************************* Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>167 - Commander&#x27;s Fall ********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>168 - Forbidden Weaponry ************************ Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>169 - Etherion ************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>170 - Divine Judgement (ending) ********************** During the &quot;Forbidden Weaponry&quot; node, talk to Rosch and join the meeting. Choose to &quot;Accept the truce&quot; to unlock this ending.</p>
      <p>171 - Royal Talisman ******************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>172 - A Black Disciple ********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>173 - Gafka &amp; the Scrolls ************************* During the &quot;Sand Fortress Siege&quot; node at Forgia, head to the village entrance and talk to Bergas to unlock this node.</p>
      <p>174 - The Ultimate Skill (sidequest) *********************** During the &quot;Sand Fortress Siege&quot; node at Forgia, head to the village entrance and talk to Bergas to receive this sidequest. You will need to find four books for Gafka.</p>
      <p>1) <Tag type="key">Strongman Book</Tag>: Search the east side of the entrance of Forgia to find a hidden chest which contains this book. 2) <Tag type="key">Tristrike Book</Tag>: Reward from &quot;The Beast God&#x27;s Birth&quot; sidequest. 3) <Tag type="key">Wind God Book</Tag>: On B4 of the Underground Lab, head up to a platform that you should search for a hidden chest which contains this book. 4) <Tag type="key">Omnipedia Book</Tag>: Reward from the &quot;A Timely Warning&quot; sidequest.</p>
      <p>After you have obtained any books, return to Bergas at &quot;Gafka &amp; the Scrolls&quot;. Defeat him each time and learn all four abilities to complete this sidequest.</p>
      <p>175 - The Beast God&#x27;s Birth (sidequest) *************************** During the &quot;Sand Fortress Siege&quot; node at Forgia, talk to Galva to receive this sidequest. Proceed to &quot;The Royal Secret&quot; node and head to Gran Plain. Go north, west, and south one screen to South Hill. In about the lower left corner, you will see a cross on the ground. Examine it to obtain the <Tag type="key">Beast God&#x27;s Nail</Tag>. Return to &quot;Gafka &amp; the Scrolls&quot;, talk to Galva, choose to &quot;Wait&quot; and &quot;Stop the ceremony&quot; to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="weapon">Magic Fist Forza</Tag> (ATK+67) and <Tag type="key">TRISTRIKE BOOK</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Gafka</Tag>, needed for &quot;The Ultimate Skill&quot; sidequest. This sidequest is a prerequisite for unlocking the &quot;Beast God at Rest&quot; part of the true ending.</p>
      <p>176 - Beast God&#x27;s Reign (ending) *********************** Follow the above steps until you begin the ceremony. Choose &quot;Don&#x27;t say anything&quot; to unlock this ending.</p>
      <p>177 - At Journey&#x27;s End (sidequest) ********************** This one is very tricky, as it has prerequisite choices to even access the sidequest, and the game doesn&#x27;t tell you. There are three decisions you have to make over the course of the game.</p>
      <p>1) During the &quot;Breakthrough&quot; node at Gran Plain, head north one screen and west to the checkpoint. You will hear someone in distress back east. Make sure to choose &quot;Let&#x27;s go save her now.&quot; 2) After the &quot;Wolf in the Fold&quot; node, return to &quot;Alistel&#x27;s Offensive&quot; and talk to Viola. Return to the &quot;A Meeting Too Late&quot; node and proceed with the plot normally. Make sure to choose &quot;I leave it to you.&quot; 3) During the &quot;Commander&#x27;s Fall&quot; node at the Sand Fortress, defeat the Thaumaton boss at the end. Afterwards, make sure to choose &quot;Bring back now.&quot;</p>
      <p>Despite that last decision occurring AFTER the time when you can access the sidequest, it is indeed a prerequisite. Return to the &quot;Gafka &amp; the Scrolls&quot; node and head to Skalla. Talk to Marco by the item shop. Then, talk to Raynie by the inn and choose &quot;I can&#x27;t give up.&quot; Talk to Marco again to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="weapon">Priere Bonheur</Tag> (ATK+15/MAG+32/Fear Res+5). This sidequest is a prerequisite for unlocking the &quot;A Warrior in Love&quot; part of the true ending.</p>
      <p>178 - Oncoming Calamity (ending) *********************** Follow the above steps until you talk to Raynie about Marco&#x27;s concerns. Choose &quot;I&#x27;ll stop fighting&quot; to unlock this ending.</p>
