      <p>179 - Waiting at Skalla *********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>180 - An Introduction ********************* Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>181 - Merchant Tarquin ********************** During &quot;An Introduction&quot; node, enter Tarquin&#x27;s shop and talk to him to unlock this node.</p>
      <p>182 - To Holff Ruins ******************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>183 - The Beast Mark Trial ************************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>184 - Overcoming the Trial ************************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>185 - The Final Defense *********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>186 - Premature Invasion (ending) ************************ During the &quot;Overcoming the Trial&quot; node, talk to Bergas and choose to &quot;Lead the way&quot; to unlock this ending.</p>
      <p>187 - The Impregnable ********************* If you have already unlocked the Escort and Sand Sword nodes, then this will be automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>188 - The Royal Throne ********************** Automatically completed during the plot.</p>
      <p>189 - Moon Armlet (sidequest) ***************** During the &quot;Waiting at Skalla&quot; node, return to Cygnus and talk to Garland to receive this sidequest. Head to the Itolia Wasteland, then go north one screen, east one, and north two. You should see a small rock formation in the middle. Search around there for the hidden <Tag type="key">Moon Armlet</Tag>. Return it to Garland to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="weapon">Suna-Watari</Tag> (ATK+42/SPD-4).</p>
      <p>190 - The Good Thief&#x27;s Way (sidequest) ************************** During the &quot;Waiting at Skalla&quot; node, return to Cygnus. Talk to Hertz &amp; Bram by the equipment shops to receive this sidequest. Return to &quot;The Beginning&quot; node at Alistel and talk to the child by the tavern. Return to the &quot;Castle Sewers&quot; node at Granorg and talk to the boy to the left of the inn. Finally, return to Hertz &amp; Bram to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="key">Piercing Scroll</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Raynie</Tag>, needed for the &quot;Raynie the Active&quot; sidequest.</p>
      <p>191 - The Living Legend (sidequest) *********************** During the &quot;Waiting at Skalla&quot; node at the Itolia Wasteland, go north one screen, west one, and continue west and up to a well. Climb down the wall to meet a man named Sword to receive this sidequest.</p>
      <p>Return to &quot;The Beginning&quot; node at Alistel. Talk to Wand, the boy inside the weapon shop, and choose &quot;Hope.&quot; Return to &quot;The Messenger&#x27;s News&quot; node and search the upper right corner to find the <Tag type="key">Shade Pact</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Stocke</Tag>. Return to the &quot;Castle Sewers&quot; node in Granorg. Talk to a man in the lower left corner named Pentacle, and choose &quot;The past.&quot; Return to the &quot;How to Disappear&quot; node, go down the sewers, and head west one screen. Search the left of the upper paths to find the hidden <Tag type="key">Sunlight Pact</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Eruca</Tag>. Return to &quot;The Beastkind Forest&quot; node and talk to Chalice, the lady by the equipment shop and choose &quot;All things&quot;. Search to the left of the sparkling bushes at the center of town to find the hidden <Tag type="key">Meteorite Pact</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Aht</Tag>. Talk to Sword again to complete this sidequest.</p>
      <p>192 - The Three Contracts ************************* After completing &quot;The Living Legend&quot; sidequest, talk to Vainqueur to unlock this node.</p>
      <p>193 - The Blades Trial (sidequest) ********************** After completing &quot;The Living Legend&quot; sidequest, talk to Vainqueur to unlock this sidequest. You will need to find four Pacts for Stocke.</p>
      <p>1) <Tag type="key">Fire Pact</Tag>: After learning Mana Sight, return to &quot;The Beginning&quot; node at Alistel. Head down to the First Ward, and search the alley behind the item shop for a hidden chest which contains this Pact. 2) <Tag type="key">Death Pact</Tag>: Reward during the &quot;Battlefield Missive&quot; sidequest. 3) <Tag type="key">Shade Pact</Tag>: Found during &quot;The Living Legend&quot; sidequest. 4) <Tag type="key">Soul Pact</Tag>: During &quot;The Road Perilous&quot; node, defeat all the Floating Stones at the Royal Hall. In the upper right part of the area are hidden barrels. Drag one of them all the way down to the rocks at the beginning. Blow away the rocks in the upper right corner to get a hidden chest which contains this Pact.</p>
      <p>After you have obtained any Pacts, return to Vainqueur at &quot;The Three Contracts&quot; and he will teach the new abilities to Stocke. Learn all four abilities to complete this sidequest. This sidequest is also a prerequisite to gain access to &quot;The Final Trial&quot; sidequest.</p>
      <p>194 - The Starlit Trial (sidequest) *********************** After completing &quot;The Living Legend&quot; sidequest, talk to Vainqueur to unlock this sidequest. You will need to find four Pacts for Aht.</p>
      <p>1) <Tag type="key">Firestar Pact</Tag>: Reward from the &quot;One &amp; Only&quot; sidequest. 2) <Tag type="key">Meteorite Pact</Tag>: Found during &quot;The Living Legend&quot; sidequest. 3) <Tag type="key">Thunderstar Pact</Tag>: During &quot;An Introduction&quot; node at Skalla, search below the weapon shop for a hidden chest which contains this Pact. 4) <Tag type="key">Icestar Pact</Tag>: During &quot;The Sacrifice&quot; node at the Imperial Ruins, climb down to the lowest level. In the upper right corner is a secret passage you can walk through to a hidden room. Search for a hidden chest which contains this Pact.</p>
      <p>After you have obtained any Pacts, return to Vainqueur at &quot;The Three Contracts&quot; and he will teach the new abilities to Aht. Learn all four abilities to complete this sidequest. This sidequest is also a prerequisite to gain access to &quot;The Final Trial&quot; sidequest.</p>
      <p>195 - The Light Trial (sidequest) ********************* After completing &quot;The Living Legend&quot; sidequest, talk to Vainqueur to unlock this sidequest. You will need to find four Pacts for Eruca.</p>
      <p>1) <Tag type="key">Firelight Pact</Tag>: Reward from &quot;The Ultimate Dish&quot; sidequest. 2) <Tag type="key">Protection Pact</Tag>: During the &quot;Gladiator&quot; node at Cygnus, head to the Back Alley area by the tavern. Search behind the wall in the lower left corner to find a hidden chest which contains this Pact. 3) <Tag type="key">Sunlight Pact</Tag>: Found during &quot;The Living Legend&quot; sidequest. 4) <Tag type="key">Divine Pact</Tag>: Found in a hidden chest at Holff Ruins.</p>
      <p>After you have obtained any Pacts, return to Vainqueur at &quot;The Three Contracts&quot; and he will teach the new abilities to Eruca. Learn all four abilities to complete this sidequest. This sidequest is also a prerequisite to gain access to &quot;The Final Trial&quot; sidequest.</p>
      <p>196 - The Final Trial (sidequest) ********************* After completing &quot;The Blades Trial&quot;, &quot;The Starlit Trial&quot;, and &quot;The Light Trial&quot;, talk to Vainqueur again to receive this sidequest. Defeat him to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="weapon">True Historica</Tag> (ATK+70/MAG+34/SPD+5).</p>
