      <p>206 - Thaumatech&#x27;s End (sidequest) ********************** During the &quot;In Pursuit&quot; node at Alistel, talk to the old man just outside the Underground Lab to receive this sidequest. Then, make your way down to the 5th basement level. Head up past the intersection and hug the left wall until you can go through a path that is rather hard to see. Defeat the Special Thaumachine there. Walk all the way out of the Underground Lab and talk to the old man again to complete this sidequest and receive a <Tag type="item">Medibranch</Tag>.</p>
      <p>207 - A Scholar&#x27;s Creed (sidequest) *********************** During the &quot;In Pursuit&quot; node at the Underground Lab, make your way down to the 7th basement level. Hug the left wall until you can go through a path that is hard to see. Talk to the engineer there to receive this sidequest. Return to &quot;The Beginning&quot; node. Talk to Fennel in the lab next to the infirmary to complete this sidequest and receive the <Tag type="key">Haste Core</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Rosch</Tag>, needed for the &quot;Conversion&quot; sidequest.</p>
